WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.160
Shireen Baratheon: The Dance of Dragons.

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:02.160
Stannis Baratheon: What’s it about?

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:06.819
Shireen: It’s the story of the fight between Rhaenyra
Targaryen and her half-brother Aegon for control

00:00:06.819 --> 00:00:08.250
of the Seven Kingdoms.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:12.070
Both of them thought they belonged on the
Iron Throne.

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:15.940
When people started declaring for one of them
or the other, their fight divided the kingdoms

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:17.020
in two.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:25.160
Brothers fought brothers, dragons fought dragons.

